OL,3,GNEWSANew online passport application
OL,4,Asystem for Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FQualifying Jersey residents are now
OL,7,Fable to apply for a British passport
OL,8,Fthrough a new online system, which
OL,9,Fshould be cheaper and quicker than the
OL,10,Fexisting paper-based service.
OL,12,FThe Customs and Immigration Service
OL,13,Fsaid the online applications would cost
OL,14,F#102 for adults and #66.50 for children
OL,15,Fwith paper applications costing an
OL,16,Fadditional #13.50 for each application.
OL,18,FIt said online applications would take
OL,19,Fabout three weeks to process while
OL,20,Fpaper-based applications take about six
OL,21,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
