OL,3,GNEWSANew online passport application
OL,4,Asystem for Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FRhiannon Small, head of service at
OL,7,FJersey Customs and Immigration Service,
OL,8,Fsaid the new system brought the island
OL,9,Fin line with similar jurisdictions.
